        <p>IT IS NOT A DYE.</p>
        <p>An absolutely perfect Hair Restorer and Dressing.</p>
        <p>This useful book is written by a dla- A tinguished London. Phys cian for the guidancs of those who suffer from Weak Sto,pach, Flatulency, or any form of Indigestion and Nervousness. It GUIDE teach s what to eat, what to avoid and how to regain... health and</p>
