      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1893-07-29_WidnesExaminer_art0077" n="art0077">
        <head>1111. VICTOR BUXTON AND THE 01 MG TRADE.</head>
        <p>1111. VICTOR BUXTON AND THE 01 MG TRADE.</p>
        <p>RUNCORN RURAL UNITARY AUTHORITY.</p>
        <p>The fortnightly meeting of this authority was held on Tuesday at Dutton Workhouse. There were present Mr.Mclntyre(chairman),Rev.J.W.N.Tanner, and J.Hanby, Messrs. E.Aaron, J. Parr, C. W.Daven- port, J. M. Williams, T. Baxter,C.C., H. E. Heywood. J Brandretb, S. Woodward, T. Lewis, E. Bratherton J. Parkinson; Mr. J. Ashton (clerk), Mr. G. Ashton (deputy clerk),Dr.Adams (medical officer of health) and Mr. J. Farrington (nuisance inspector).</p>
        <p>CLUBS. ANNUAL MEETINGS. The annual general meeting of the members Earlestown Football Club waa helu in the Go'</p>
