-street. v2'34 secretary. A list of fixtures for the coming season read by the secretary. It was stated that the/ gained admission to the West Lancashire League' en September 23rd would play their first league 0' against the sth Irish at Liverpool. The reserve play several good matches, and Itave still a fo'i dates for junior clubs. The committee hope to strong first team, and they anticipate a ta/ season. Mr. C. Naylor was appointed league After the business had been disposed of a social' e` was spent, songs tieing contributed by several, ulo The meeting closed with a vote of thanks to tbe man.</p>
