        <p>GOOF) ADVICE. FOR PURE DRUGS. PURE CHEMiCALS. FIRST CLASS DISPENSING. EXQUISITE PERFUMES. PATENT MEDICINES A T COST PRICES; GOOD AND CHEAP SPOISGES go to SANKEY-ST. PHARMACY, 63. SANKEY-ST. (Opposite Legh-st.) WARRINGTON. PROPRIETOB: HENRY M. ASHTON, A.P.S. Chemist by Eximination.</p>
